1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,530
Don't paste the landlord's lease into ChatGPT yet!

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:05,130
Why not. It's just a lease.

3
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:07,850
With his name, your rent and your signature!

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,650
ChatGPT won't tell anyone.

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,010
On personal plans, chats can be used to train models.

6
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:15,220
There's a switch for that. Check it.

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,620
And the names?

8
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,980
Cut names, numbers, anything you wouldn't tape to the register.

9
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,780
Okay. Remove the landlord.

10
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,510
Not like that. New item: the Redacted Reuben.

11
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:27,110
Fine. Then I paste the lease.

